  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a813b4b831bc3bf0",
      "translationZh": "一段枯燥的 Jinja 片段能告诉我们关于新 Qwen-3 模型的哪些信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64b593a02a2cd4c7",
      "translationZh": "Qwen 推出的新 Qwen-3 模型附带的聊天模板，比其前代模型 Qwen-2.5 和 QwQ 的模板复杂得多。通过查看 Jinja 模板中的差异，我们可以对新模型获得一些有意思的洞察。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "624ebfc55541da01",
      "translationZh": "聊天模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd592c186f579af6",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 聊天模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fcf67db83e99102c",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-2.5 聊天模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5fc11ae63de48b8",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-QwQ 聊天模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "213b7249fa5b567a",
      "translationZh": "什么是聊天模板？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b846cf71e32b6a8",
      "translationZh": "聊天模板定义了用户与模型之间的对话如何组织和格式化。模板充当转换器，将人类可读的对话进行转换：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d39edc9a97a31c7b",
      "translationZh": "转换为适合模型处理的格式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9246ca28c12d832a",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face 的模型页面上轻松查看相应模型的聊天模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0373cc6d1361701",
      "translationZh": "Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B 的聊天模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3018e21d4fc1fac3",
      "translationZh": "让我们深入了解 Qwen-3 的聊天模板，看看能从中学到什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea81b6d34270d809",
      "translationZh": "1. 推理不必强制进行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce89b15025321723",
      "translationZh": "而且，你可以通过简单的预填充，让推理变为可选项……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df0d40a65fe66fce",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 的独特之处在于，它能够通过 enable_thinking 标志开启或关闭推理。当该标志设为 false 时，模板会插入一对空的 <think></think> 标签，告诉模型跳过逐步思考。早期模型将 <think> 标签固化在每次生成中，无论你是否需要，都会强制进行思维链推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7ffffb4c4366f6e",
      "translationZh": "例如，QwQ 会在每次对话中强制进行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c7d309efb25b9e8",
      "translationZh": "如果 enable_thinking 为 true，模型就能够自行决定是否进行思考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30fe77e3aa68ec71",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用以下代码测试该模板：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9632a9269725f2ff",
      "translationZh": "2. 上下文管理应当是动态的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b76434f09ce956c",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 采用滚动检查点系统，智能地保留或裁剪推理块，以维持相关上下文。较早的模型为了节省 token，会过早丢弃推理内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2aeccde1528b11a5",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 引入了“滚动检查点”：通过逆序遍历消息列表，找到最近一个并非工具调用的用户轮次。对于该索引之后的所有助手回复，它会保留完整的 <think> 块；在此之前的则全部剥离。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e769483bea58d15a",
      "translationZh": "这为何重要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b9563d789b8f13a",
      "translationZh": "在多步工具调用期间，让当前计划保持可见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07cf2205db37adb1",
      "translationZh": "支持嵌套式工具工作流，而不会丢失上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea08b081ad18176c",
      "translationZh": "通过剪除模型不再需要的思考来节省 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63ce7d793a61d96a",
      "translationZh": "防止“过时”的推理渗入新任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d029f87e3d80f8fd",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dbb78f8db778b44",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个使用 Qwen-3 和 QwQ 在工具调用过程中保留思维链的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b60faee615eadced",
      "translationZh": "可以使用 @huggingface/jinja 来测试聊天模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c5f3c6611938809c",
      "translationZh": "3. 工具参数需要更好的序列化处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20654699615c4ba2",
      "translationZh": "此前，每个 tool_call.arguments 字段都会通过管道传给 | tojson，即使它已经是一个经过 JSON 编码的字符串，也会如此处理——这存在双重转义的风险。Qwen‑3 会先检查类型，仅在必要时才进行序列化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e60b52970b948840",
      "translationZh": "4. 无需默认系统提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3e10bd09660ce87",
      "translationZh": "与许多模型一样，Qwen‑2.5 系列也有一个默认的系统提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66b9ea09bd5b7099",
      "translationZh": "你是 Qwen，由 Alibaba Cloud 创建。你是一个乐于助人的助手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2c680ac751e48b9",
      "translationZh": "这种做法相当常见，因为它有助于模型回答用户提出的“你是谁？”之类的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "995c5cf195677e7e",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 和 QwQ 发布时不带这个默认的系统提示词。尽管如此，如果你询问模型，它仍然能够准确指出自己的创建者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f6b6c9b8bf125e6",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-3 向我们展示了，通过 chat_template，我们可以提供更好的灵活性、更智能的上下文处理和更完善的工具交互。这些改进不仅提升了能力，还使智能体工作流更加可靠、高效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
